# Striped flatweave living-area rug (issue 166): denim and cream stripes along its long side, a denim border, cream fringe at the short ends and a faint weave texture. Seen from above like the floor: flat, ink outline, palette only, no print or text. 8x4 tiles. Lies on the floor under the furniture and the player.
size: 128x64
